  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="a86be7e9-a521-420f-bc87-0699ce61b7bf"><problem><para>
      <para>Sketch or describe the figure in Step 4 and Step 15.
          
          <figure><media alt="Three steps of a growing pattern"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/7af9c38ee51b4d3864f92f32f049e74eb31e64ad"/></media></figure></para>
      <para> How many small squares are in Step 4? </para>
        <para> Enter your answer here: </para>
    </para></problem><solution><para>16</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is 16.
      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
